/*--------------------------------------------

 Le Grand full theoretical eye: RELAXED (eye power 59.940 D, length 24.197 mm)

 Source: TEVOI (Smith & Atchison, The Eye and Visual Optical Instruments, Cambridge University Press 1997), Appendix 3 'Schematic eyes', p. 784.
 Surfaces R 7.8, 6.5, 10.2, -6.0 mm; n 1.3771, 1.3374, 1.4200, 1.3360; d 0.55, 3.05, 4.0 mm.
 Only the published eye is here: the spectacle correction and the accommodating lens that used to sit in front of the cornea
 have been taken out. The 4 mm stop (at the front of the lens) is the app's usual pupil.

----------------------------------------------*/
{
	"category"    : "Schematic eyes",
	"subcategory" : "Le Grand",
	"keywords"    : [ "schematic eye", "Le Grand" ],
	"shortName"   : "Relaxed",
	"about"       : "The Le Grand full theoretical relaxed eye: cornea, aqueous humour, lens and vitreous, ending at the retina (eye power 59.94 D).",
	"reference"   : "Smith G, Atchison DA (1997) The Eye and Visual Optical Instruments (TEVOI). Cambridge University Press. Appendix 3, Schematic eyes, p. 784",


	"units" : "m",

	"viewBox" : [ -0.010, 0.007, 0.040, 0.014 ],


	"sources" : [ { "id" 		: 1, 
					"type" 		: "object",
					"infinity"	: true,
					"which"		: "object",
					"beamwidth" : 0.004,
					"z"			: NaN, 
					"h"			: NaN,
					"t"			: 10 } ],



	/* SCHEMATIC OF EYE WITH PRESCRIPTION */

	"schematic" : { 	"model" : "eye",
						"show"	: true,  
						"map"   : { "anterior_cornea" : "0006",
									"anterior_lens"   : "00010",
									"retina" 		  : "0014" }},


	/* LENS PRESCRITPION */

	"title": "Le Grand full theoretical eye relaxed",
    "prescription": [{
		"id": "0001",
		"type": "index",
		"description": "air#1",
		"args": {
			"index": 1.000
		}
	}, {		
		"id": "0006",
		"group": "cornea",
		"type": "sphere",
		"description": "anterior cornea",
		"args": {
			"radius": 0.007800,
			"height": 0.01,
			"aperture": 0.01
		}
	}, {
		"id": "0007",
		"group": "cornea",
		"type": "index",
		"description": "cornea",
		"args": {
			"index": 1.3771,
			"thickness": 0.00055
		}
	}, {
		"id": "0008",
		"group": "cornea",		
		"type": "sphere",
		"description": "posterior cornea",
		"args": {
			"radius": 0.006500,
			"height": 0.01,
			"aperture": 0.01
		}
	}, {
		"id": "0009",
		"type": "index",
		"description": "aqueous",
		"args": {
			"index": 1.3374,
			"thickness": 0.00305
		}
	}, {
		"id": "00010",
		"group": "lens",
		"type": "sphere",
		"description": "anterior lens",
		"args": {
			"radius"   : 0.010200,
			"stop"     : true,
			"height"   : 0.01,			
			"aperture" : 0.004
		}
	}, {
		"id": "00011",
		"group": "lens",
		"type": "index",
		"description": "lens",
		"args": {
			"index": 1.4200,
			"thickness": 0.004
		}
	}, {
		"id": "0012",
		"group": "lens",		
		"type": "sphere",
		"description": "posterior lens",
		"args": {
			"radius": -0.006000,
			"height": 0.01,
			"aperture": 0.01
		}
	}, {
